---
description: Deployment and runtime guidance (Docker, Cloudflare Workers, K8s)
globs:
  - "Dockerfile"
  - "docker-compose.yaml"
  - "wrangler.toml"
  - "deployment.yaml"
  - "src/start-server.ts"
alwaysApply: false
---

- Docker
  - Keep images minimal. Use node:lts-slim. Avoid dev dependencies at runtime.
  - Set NODE_ENV=production. Run as non-root where possible.

- Cloudflare Workers (wrangler)
  - Use fetch handlers without Node-only APIs. Guard conditional imports.
  - Ensure bundling targets Workers runtime; avoid fs/net modules.

- Kubernetes/compose
  - Expose minimal ports; configure resources and probes. Externalize secrets.
  - Make replicas and autoscaling explicit for critical paths.

